questions.stem:
In the given reaction,
$X+Y+3Z \rightleftharpoons X YZ_3$
if one mole of each of $X$ and $Y$ with $0.05\ \mathrm{mol}$ of $Z$ gives compound $X Y Z_3$ - (Given : Atomic masses of $X, Y$ and $Z$ are 10, 20 and $30\ \mathrm{amu}$, respectively.) The yield of $X Y Z_3$ is _______g. (Nearest integer)
